                  %strong cosmological constant
          %h2#references References
          %h3#general General
          %p Introduction and review:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Konstantinos Xenos,
                %em An Introduction to FRW Cosmology and dark energy models
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.06135"}> arXiv:2101.06135
