                  run?
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.08773"}> arXiv:2412.08773
                \&amp;rbrack;
              %blockquote
                %p (No.)
          %h3#tests Tests
          %p Tests to constrain the value of the cosmological constant are developed in:
          %ul
            %li
